Type: project
Description: Dependency declarations for tools that scan this project
    (renv, rsconnect/Posit Connect). ragg is referenced via runtime
    indirection in app.R so that Shinylive/WebAssembly builds do not
    require it; declaring it here keeps server deployments installing it.
    scripts/export_shinylive.R stages only app.R, R/ and www/, so this
    file is never seen by the Shinylive dependency scanner.
Imports:
    ragg
